  "title": "The Applications of Agroforestry",
  "summary": "Agroforestry is the intentional integration of trees and shrubs into crop and animal farming systems. Planting trees in agricultural environments can create environmental, economic, and social benefits. It is considered one of the earliest forms of agriculture and has been sustainably practiced by indigenous peoples worldwide for generations.",
